.TH "GH-ISSUE-ARTIFACT" "1" "Oct 2026" "GitHub CLI 2.103.3" "GitHub CLI manual"

.SH NAME
gh-issue-artifact - Work with issue artifacts (preview)


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgh issue artifact <command> [flags]\fR


.SH DESCRIPTION
Working with issue artifacts in the GitHub CLI is in preview and subject to change without notice.

.PP
Issue artifacts are Markdown documents, HTML documents and links attached to an issue.
They are not GitHub Actions artifacts; to download those, use \fBgh run download\fR\&.


.SH AVAILABLE COMMANDS
.TP
\fBgh-issue-artifact-create(1)\fR
Create issue artifacts (preview)

.TP
\fBgh-issue-artifact-delete(1)\fR
Delete issue artifacts (preview)

.TP
\fBgh-issue-artifact-download(1)\fR
Download issue artifacts (preview)

.TP
\fBgh-issue-artifact-edit(1)\fR
Edit an issue artifact (preview)

.TP
\fBgh-issue-artifact-list(1)\fR
List artifacts on an issue (preview)

.TP
\fBgh-issue-artifact-view(1)\fR
View an issue artifact (preview)


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
.TP
\fB-R\fR, \fB--repo\fR \fB<[HOST/]OWNER/REPO>\fR
Select another repository using the [HOST/]OWNER/REPO format


.SH EXIT CODES
0: Successful execution

.PP
1: Error

.PP
2: Command canceled

.PP
4: Authentication required

.PP
NOTE: Specific commands may have additional exit codes. Refer to the command's help for more information.


